
/*

ptr -> ptr ka assign kiya gaya address
&ptr -> ptr ka apna address
*ptr -> ptr ke assign kiya gaya address ki value


Is example mein:

ptr → 1000, yaani name ka address.
&ptr → 2000, yaani ptr variable ka address.
*ptr → 'd', yaani name[0] ki value.


*/


